The '''Mushroom Tree Seed''' is a seed that grows into a [[Mushroom Tree]].  It's purchasable from [[Mr. Qi]]'s shop in  [[Qi's Walnut Room]], for {{Price|5|gem}} [[Qi Gem|Qi Gems]]. They can also be obtained from the natural seed spread near a Mushroom Tree. They ''cannot'' be obtained by shaking Mushroom Trees.
