==Tailoring==
Mushroom Tree Seed can be used in the spool of the [[2 Willow Lane#Sewing Machine|Sewing Machine]] to create the {{Name|Star Helmet|class=inline}}. It can also serve as a red dye color in the sewing machine or dye pots, located at [[Emily]]'s and [[Haley]]'s house, [[2 Willow Lane]].

